1. In the find method, there is a typo: "i-=1" should be "i+=1" (increment i when characters match, not decrement). The logic: while i < len(s) and j < len(d), if s[i] == d[j], then move both pointers forward; else move only i forward. The code has i-=1 which is wrong.

